# Force LF line endings for Terraform files, regardless of local git config.
# Prevents CRLF/LF mismatches between Windows checkouts and Linux CI runners
# from appearing as spurious diffs on multi-line string resources (e.g.
# snowflake_execute.execute), which would otherwise force unwanted replacement.
*.tf text eol=lf
*.tfvars text eol=lf
*.hcl text eol=lf
